":"宋"}},{"title":"赠何符山人二首 其二","author":"陈造","text":"冷看俗态诙嘲里，缓阅年光醉梦间。\n想得酒瓢诗卷外，此生无物更相关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":19040,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠何符山人二首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"小诗落纸粲春葩，传遍侯家与主家。\n未怪东来将只影，十年囊笔饭京华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":19041,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠净慈主人五首 其五","author":"陈造","text":"师似蜚云未定居，我方薄宦走江湖。\n鼎山他日过从约，借问今犹记得无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":19042,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠净慈主人五首 其四","author":"陈造","text":"寺前寺后花如锦，相见游人拨不开。\n好把春光供一笑，从渠尘袜涴苍苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":19043,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]